 ALE IDOCS
 ---------
 It will help to transfer the data from one system to another system

 Idoc structure  :
 -----------------
 1. Control Record
 It consists of receiver information, sender information, port information and RFC connection information
 2. Data record
 It consists of Actual data which we are transferring from one system to another system
 3. Status record
 It consists of status of Idoc whether it is which status failed or success or in process

 Tables :
 -------
 1. Control date-EDIDC
 2. Data record ---EDID4
 3. Status record-EDIDS

