 Inbound Idoc message number :
 -----------------------------
 50-Idoc Added
 64-Ready to proceed
 62-Idoc passed application
 53-IDOC successfully updated
 51-Idoc failed
 69-edit and ready to process
 68-Idoc deleted

 Outbound Idoc message numbers :
 ------------------------------
 01-Idoc generated
 30-Ready to proceed
 03-Idoc successful
 02-Idoc failed

